// flux-2/edit pass each; the garland close-up re-run on another seed, which
// had painted words on its board, and cropped above the platform that run
// added). "Take NOT its snowflakes" in the prompt was not enough — a render
// still copied two of them into the garland.
//
// The customer's reference photo, 720px wide, as a JPEG data URI.
